            "tender": {
                "id": "CF-2831100D0O000000rwimUAA",
                "title": "Provision of Public Health Knowledge and Library Services from UKHSA",
                "description": "The UKHSA library service provides comprehensive support to public health professionals and other senior leaders working in the NSHE through an extensive array of resources and expert services. Practitioners benefit from access to a vast collection of e-journals, e-books, and physical collections, ensuring they have the information needed for informed decision-making. The library offers skilled literature searching and precise information retrieval, along with document delivery and inter-library loans to quickly fulfill resource needs. Staff also receive support in copyright and licensing, as well as regular knowledge updates and tailored alerting services to stay current with the latest research. By promoting and facilitating access to these resources and offering training in information skills, the library service empowers NHS practitioners with essential tools to enhance patient care and advance their professional expertise.",
